WEBVTT

00:03:59.996 --> 00:04:04.329
It dawned on me that the Vietnam War was
very similar to my father's experience,

00:04:04.954 --> 00:04:08.163
that we kept investing more and more.

00:04:08.163 --> 00:04:10.496
We kept having larger and larger losses,

00:04:10.496 --> 00:04:16.038
but we kept as a country refusing to admit
that this was unlikely to succeed.

00:04:16.538 --> 00:04:19.954
Today, Barry is an organizational behavior
professor at UC Berkeley,

00:04:20.454 --> 00:04:23.121
and he coined the concept of
escalation of commitment.

00:04:23.246 --> 00:04:26.538
Escalation of commitment
occurs when you're in

00:04:26.538 --> 00:04:33.579
a situation in which it is possible to add
more resources to a course of action